&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2317539&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity Run All Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16687838" author="nsamelchev" created="Thu, 15 Nov 2018 11:00:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Problem was that coordinator fails when process the fail message about itself. Reproducer attached to PR.&lt;br/&gt;
I have fixed this issue by disabling removing itself from the ring (like as on node leaving). When coordinator process message it will send verify message across ring and nodes will remove him from ring map. The new coordinator will send the discard message and ends the node fail process.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Could anyone review, please?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16700342" author="ignitetcbot" created="Tue, 27 Nov 2018 12:32:04 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #F7D6C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Possible Blockers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d04437&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;Inspections&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Core&lt;/font&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2400898]&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;[tests 0 BuildFailureOnMetric &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
